## Why This Is Asked
This question evaluates understanding of on-device, privacy-preserving ML systems with per-domain adapters that load dynamically while maintaining strict privacy guarantees in a chat application context.

## Key Concepts
- On-device fine-tuning with per-domain adapters
- Dynamic adapter loading from secure knowledge bases
- Adapter injection points (attention vs FFN layers)
- Quantization trade-offs (4-bit vs 8-bit)
- Domain gating and routing strategies
- Memory budgeting for mobile deployment
- Cross-domain evaluation and privacy compliance

## Code Example
